Kansas QSO Party in-state received locations (2026 rules)
Maximum 64 multipliers: 50 US states, 13 provinces/territories and one DX.
Every Kansas county maps to Ks, so the first Kansas county logged is the Kansas multiplier.
The Ks line has a display name and NO alias: KS is never received instead of a county.
No DC line: the rules list 50 states and DXLog and N1MM refuse DC too.

INCLUDE FILE kansas_cty.dom
Ks = ^Kansas
Al = AL,^Alabama
Ak = AK,^Alaska
Az = AZ,^Arizona
